OL,3,GNEWSASergeant who saved woman from
OL,4,Adrowning honoured
OL,5,
OL,6,FA police sergeant who was praised for
OL,7,Frisking his own life to help save a
OL,8,Fwoman from drowning said it was "very
OL,9,Fhumbling" to be recognised at a special
OL,10,Fceremony.
OL,12,FSgt Dave Hicks was among dozens of
OL,13,Femergency service workers and
OL,14,Fvolunteers honoured at a ceremony in
OL,15,FLiverpool Parish Church.
OL,17,FMerseyside Police said it was an
OL,18,F"extraordinary act of bravery" for Sgt
OL,19,FHicks to rescue the woman in Liverpool
OL,20,FBay on 17 August 2024 and his actions
OL,21,F"undoubtedly saved her life".
